I've never seen a thrown rubber chicken work.  No idea if it can.  I see
in othre posts you used it in melee then lucked out of the 50-50 chance
of lightning.  If the lightning bolt is thrown and it fails there's a
disintegration bolt next.  Thats' the main reason I tend to use the
strategy of staying outside of the shrine and firing through the dug out
wall.


